{"id":2402,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>期末考试临近，为严肃考场纪律、坚决遏制作弊歪风，进一步强化学生的规则意识与诚信素养，引导广大学生以端正、严谨的态度迎接各类考试，我院近期集中开展考风考纪教育，从严从实筑牢考试公平底线，积极营造风清气正的考试氛围。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eMR7yZolUPLmMRMhmGbnNrkM4GaMmr32LRlZoR-aMzCYo7l0gihFp2hmCIa0okhVMYhRMkysMzr2nlC8M4vinzrko7Lbnz-aLml4MzNanNMFMm-YnlQkUzfFLzGioznVgjfJQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4LRCZMYbw62B8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30687&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8E7C4755FEF4775E5B8C9E20253590FC/622EFBA0/10594E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=enz7yaM87bUz-sUhN-bLN-8n7CDo7r3fLNr7UzAfozCaMmC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhkoSyZnkh7oRNZMmVRn7CDMR7anzM2LzGaM7-ZLNL8UmrFnmU8MmnVoRTFLNCan7W2gjfJQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4LRCZMYbw62B8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30687&e=.png\"></p><p>学院构建了线上线下相结合的立体化宣传矩阵，全面强化诚信应考教育。一方面，依托微信公众号、班级群组等新媒体平台，持续推送诚信考试倡议书、违纪处分办法解读及警示教育案例，引导学生认清作弊行为的严重危害；另一方面，组织各班级召开“诚信应考”主题班会，围绕真实案例展开深入讨论，强化学生“作弊可耻、诚信光荣”的价值认同。此外，在学生宿舍楼下宣传栏等公共场所张贴诚信考试海报及通知，实现警示教育线上线下全覆盖，切实增强学生的自律意识和底线思维。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eLzMyknmr7n7nVLhzT7M8r7ol7YMmL3bMRGPM47DolrfLll0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyinShRn1h7L4W2M4QfM4G8LR98UmNiMRNZo7LiU874MlVFL4-DLzlanzMFL4Q2o7LJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LaMm9sgtA8pUBcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30687&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D5ECFD32F76A704084B954988C5CA35A/326150E3/36F8C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 300px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eLzMyknmr7n7nVLhzT7M8r7ol7YMmL3bMRGPM47DolrfLll0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyinShRn1h7L4W2M4QfM4G8LR98UmNiMRNZo7LiU874MlVFL4-DLzlanzMFL4Q2o7LJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LaMm9sgtA8pUBcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30687&e=.jpg\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL4My7UmARL8QknhmQVMRfVUl7sMmv38MzN8oRU4UN-bnR-0gihFp2hmCIa0okyaokybnSyDL7lPn7LDLmNPnN78MzvDnz9ZLRCbMN-bLmfFMRlsMzrRUmQFL4M7UmGJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LaMm9sgtA8pUBcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30687&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8089E60E1DC6291FA4576E880696B920/45755CB6/33DB0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 315px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eLzWyfUmGaLm-snh7l8MmNsnNl8L4G3aL467U8UaUNUYMlU0gihFp2hmCIa0LSy8LkyDn1ybnRW2LNMfnRARoR6kLRAVLmn7nRnkUNUsoRrFnN-iLRL4MzfFL4NaM46VgjfJQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4LRCZMYbw62B8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30687&e=.png\"></p><p>此次诚信应考宣传教育，不仅有助于学生树立正确的考试观、价值观，更推动形成了“以实力作答、以诚信立身”的校园共识。下一步，学院将持续优化诚信教育长效机制，常态化开展考风考纪督导，不断强化学风建设，引导学生在诚信考试中锤炼品格、提升素质，以扎实的学识和过硬的作风迎接人生每一次考验。</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eMR7yZolUPLmMRMhmGbnNrkM4GaMmr32LRlZoR-aMzCYo7l0gihFp2hmCIa0okhVMYhRMkysMzr2nlC8M4vinzrko7Lbnz-aLml4MzNanNMFMm-YnlQkUzfFLzGioznVgjfJQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4LRCZMYbw62B8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30687&e=.png"}